increasePositionCollateral.t.sol
├── when caller is not the position owner
│   └── it should revert with {PERPEX__NOT_POSITION_OWNER} error
└── when caller is the position owner
    ├── when position is already closed
    │   └── it should revert with {PERPEX__POSITION_ALREADY_CLOSED} error
    └── when position is open
        ├── it should increase position collateral by collateral amount
        ├── it should emit the {PositionCollateralIncreased} event
        └── it should transfer collateral from user to perpex
